APPLICATION, EDUCATION, AI, AND THIRD-PARTY DATA NOTICE
--------------------------------------------------------
Mazkiplay Trade is an analysis, market-data, journaling, education, paper/manual
trade-planning, and explanation application. It is not financial advice and does
not guarantee profit, execution, liquidity, price accuracy, model output, or
availability of any provider. Users remain responsible for every trading
decision and must independently verify prices, spreads, fees, contract
specifications, and broker rules.

Academy content is original educational material for Mazkiplay Trade. It is not
an investment recommendation, solicitation to buy or sell assets, or guarantee
of profit. Trading involves the risk of losing capital.

AI features are optional explanation tools. Deterministic market, technical,
fundamental, news, and risk engines remain the source of critical numbers. AI
must not receive private broker/exchange keys or execute orders directly.
User credentials are stored locally through Android Keystore-backed encryption;
no developer API keys are included in the source or APK configuration.

Market data, news, chart content, QRIS/payment imagery, video, and calendar
content may be provided by third-party services, including TradingView,
Indodax, CoinGecko, Yahoo Finance, RSS publishers, YouTube, and official
central-bank sources. Each provider retains its own terms, copyrights, rate
limits, embedding rules, and redistribution restrictions. Official live-event
links are opened externally when embedding is not authorized.

Only public read-only market endpoints are used by the default application;
private account APIs, wallet keys, broker execution, and DEX execution require
separate authorization and secure server-side integration.

The QRIS asset is supplied by the project owner for the donation screen and
must not be repurposed as a payment credential outside the owner's intended
use.
